Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,YEND Z Friend By strawberries online
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.99,0:00:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,uuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuu\NYAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.15,0:00:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YOKI uğs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.85,0:01:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Finalists and guests, may I\Nhave your attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.53,0:01:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The second duel of the Battle\NCity Finals is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, and the selector will now\Nrandomly pick the next two duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember your numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.29,0:01:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are selected, you'll be participating\Nin the second duel of the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.27,0:01:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And the first duelist chosen\Nis number two, Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.17,0:01:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's time to kick\Nsome major butt. And Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler's opponent in this duel\Nis number seven, Merrick Ishtar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.61,0:01:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's go time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.15,0:01:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's facing off against Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.15,0:01:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's planning on using his\NMillennium Rod to win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So Joey's gotta be ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.85,0:01:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you brought a parachute, because\NI'm blasting you right off this blimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.93,0:02:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that, Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.75,0:02:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, both duelists will now\Ntake their places in the arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.85,0:02:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Elevate the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of this duel will advance to\Nthe next round of the Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The loser will be dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.01,0:02:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, gentlemen, it's time to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.47,0:02:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you'll please take your places\Non either end of the playing field,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.85,0:02:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we can get this duel underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.43,0:02:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Show Tattoo Face what\Ndueling's all about, Joey! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey looks really fired\Nup to duel Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, when Joey gets really\Nsteamed, he tends to shoot his mouth off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But he better watch what\Nhe says to this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.45,0:02:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's mean enough without Joey's lip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.79,0:02:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's gotta stay focused and\Nstop shuffling his deck already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that Joey's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Serenity,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.85,0:02:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot this is your first time\Nseeing your brother duel, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.59,0:02:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.53,0:03:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure with you here cheering\Nhim on, there's no way he'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.01,0:03:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.77,0:03:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You've shuffled enough\Ncards for ten duels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.37,0:03:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now both of you take your positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.99,0:03:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make this wacko wish he\Nnever tried to control my noggin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.41,0:03:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, listen up, you bald-headed freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.29,0:03:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,According to my math, you're gonna\Nbe all washed up in nine turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.05,0:03:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's if he can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he come up with nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, with Joey, you don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.91,0:03:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's so awesome, he's got this\Nwhole duel calculated in his head already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.11,0:03:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You just keep believing\Neverything he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.37,0:03:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be what he used to control me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.77,0:03:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew Merrick would\Nuse it to win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That coward can't win on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Point that thing somewhere\Nelse and duel like a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.03,0:03:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Merrick. Did you say, "Very well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:03:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick must have realized that Joey's\Nmind is too strong to be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the Millennium\NRod didn't work last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.79,0:04:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Little do they know that\NOdeon's Millennium Rod is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.05,0:04:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,merely a replica of the\Noriginal item held by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,These fools will never suspect that I am\Nthe one they fear and despise so greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And while I hide safely in the shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.23,0:04:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon will fight my battles\Nfor me But something else
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It concerns me. It's Seto Kaiba\Nand his role in this struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.17,0:04:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Yugi isn't the only\None standing between me and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.43,0:04:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the power of the Pharaoh\NFor the ancient tablets also
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,depict a sorcerer Who bears\Na striking resemblance to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.09,0:04:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba And what concerns me\Neven more is what appears to be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Rod in the hands\Nof this sorcerer, so I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.13,0:04:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,keep an eye on him as well And\Nbefore the finals are over,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.11,0:04:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's Egyptian god card, Obelisk\Nthe Tormentor, will belong to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba could never comprehend\Nthat card's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as Odeon continues to\Ndeceive everyone into believing he is me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,my plan to obtain the two\Nremaining Egyptian god
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,cards and Yugi's Millennium\NPuzzle should be simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.01,0:05:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show Seto Kaiba what\Ntrue power is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.63,0:05:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto, if Merrick really is\Nthe leader of the Rare Hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,he must have, like, a ton\Nof rare cards in his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one card in\Nhis deck I care about,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.15,0:05:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's his Egyptian god\Ncard, the Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.15,0:05:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And hopefully that hack, Joey Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.37,0:05:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,will last long enough in this duel for\Nme to see how Merrick's card works,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can win it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.99,0:05:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.59,0:05:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't defeat this\Npathetic fool, Joey Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,then you don't stand a\Nchance against the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So unless you'd like to take an\Nunexpected journey to the Shadow Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd suggest you refrain\Nfrom disappointing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.15,0:05:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.93,0:06:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I pledge my word that I shall\Ndefeat this worthless opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.01,0:06:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.91,0:06:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel and destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, let the duel begin. Prepare\Nfor defeat. Don't count on it. Marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm not scared of you i'll start you\Nfreak that's right you the man joey show
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,this robed weirdo who's boss hey yuki\Ndid joey ever take back his red eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,black dragon card huh he'll be all right\Ncome on joey you've Come this far, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.05,0:06:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'll bet he's never faced an\Nopponent as unpredictable as this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we've all seen the kind\Nof evil Merrick's capable of,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's pretty obvious\Nhe's not to be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's just got to keep his cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked really hard to get to the\Nfinals, and I can't screw this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And just think, if I defeat this\Nevil nutcase, I'll be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.99,0:07:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have knocked him out of the\Ncompetition and saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.93,0:07:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be famous, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey, you might want to actually\Nhold on to your cards for this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, he needs support.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice catch, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Note to self, beware of gusty winds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What was Kaiba thinking\Nholding a duel up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey, stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.39,0:07:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, where was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Acting like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough out of you, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.47,0:07:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.65,0:07:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I summon Gear Free, the\NIron Knight, in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.87,0:07:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, now this is looking like a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's more where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see what you've got, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.11,0:07:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play Temple of the Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.15,0:07:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A card like none you've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.15,0:08:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with that building, Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The structure behind me is the\Nancient temple of the kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.73,0:08:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Within this 5,000-year-old sanctuary lie
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the greatest treasures\Nof the kings of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.21,0:08:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And what does that big shack do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.01,0:08:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,To protect the king's treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,it limits the number of magic and\Ntrap cards you can play in one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And in front of the temple,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lay two cards face down as\Nan extra boundary of protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And with this move, I end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.31,0:08:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So try to attack me if you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.71,0:08:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea what danger\Nlurks within these temple walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick hasn't even summoned one monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his life point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.51,0:08:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.45,0:08:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Merrick probably\Nwants him to attack so he can
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,activate his face-down cards and\Nput a serious hurting on Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.19,0:08:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too risky, dummy. Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.75,0:08:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey does need to watch out\Nfor Merrick's face-down cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:09:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But what worries me even more\Nis Merrick's Egyptian temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.53,0:09:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what's hiding in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.13,0:09:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,These fools have no idea of the\Nancient fury that awaits them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.45,0:09:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let him smell my fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.43,0:09:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.31,0:09:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything all right, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You look pretty scared, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I was afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.75,0:09:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, if I'm gonna beat this guy,\NI gotta pull myself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.11,0:09:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That two-bit temple's got\Nnothing on my giant trunade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.77,0:09:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This card will get rid of\Nall his magic and trap cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can totally dismantle\Nhis Temple of the Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.39,0:09:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the delay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.30,0:09:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you realize that no matter\Nwhat you do, you're finished, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So make your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I got my plan to win this\Nduel all figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.71,0:09:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll summon a few more\Nmonsters to build up my attack power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't attack! Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.55,0:09:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maric will probably play a\Ncouple more face-down cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.97,0:09:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking he's got me trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's when I'll spring\Nmy giant Tornado on him,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,blasting away all his trap cards and\Nreducing his temple to a pile of rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.23,0:09:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally, my army of monsters\Nwill wipe out his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That evil freak show\Nwon't know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.93,0:10:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodnight, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.77,0:10:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Tiny Guardian in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's all I'm gonna\Ndo for now, Chrome Dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.89,0:10:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's got to attack him sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that my big brother\Nhas some kind of plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.31,0:10:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.03,0:10:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I placed two more cards face down on\Nthe field, and now my move is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.55,0:10:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Merrick's got four cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.81,0:10:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That spineless snake is just going to\Nsit back and wait for Joey to attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When he does, Merrick will\Nspring one of his traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.65,0:10:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the oldest and\Nwimpiest trick in the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Q-Ball, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.95,0:10:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Hayabusa Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have enough monsters on the\Nfield to wipe out his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.83,0:10:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But first,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I got to play Giant True Name and clear\Nthe field of all his magic and trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.37,0:10:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to demolish\Nthat ancient palace of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.65,0:11:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, I play Giant True Name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick will have nothing on\Nthe field to protect himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Joey's the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Beating this guy was way\Neasier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, True Name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow his cards off the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.83,0:11:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cards should have been history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your giant trunade is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And your troubles have only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.23,0:11:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get what just\Nhappened to my magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It was supposed to get rid of\Nevery card you had on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.27,0:11:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.69,0:11:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,When you made the very foolish decision\Nto activate your giant trunade, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,you in turn triggered\None of the most dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,traps I've placed on the\Nfield to protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and now it's time for you to\Npay the price for your mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.83,0:12:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, with all of\Nmy trap cards in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.27,0:12:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you wouldn't\Nattack me with a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You tried to destroy my\Ntraps with a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you played a trap card\Nthat destroys magic cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all that it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.07,0:12:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The trap you've just triggered\Nis about to devastate all of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,your monsters and an extremely\Nlarge portion of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.65,0:12:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So prepare to feel its\Nwrath right now. Now, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.01,0:12:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Judgment of Anubis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.13,0:12:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Never have you experienced a trap\Nwith a destructive force such as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Judgment of Anubis will now annihilate\Nevery monster you have on the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.03,0:12:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,field and deduct half of their\Nattack points from your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.55,0:12:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.99,0:12:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Anubis, destroy! Rejoice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.39,0:12:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Building up your army of powerful\Nmonsters was a grave miscalculation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.53,0:12:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,because they're about to disappear with\Nmore than 2,000 of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.69,0:13:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you just wasted my best guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.19,0:13:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,When you see the horrors that await you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,those monsters will be the\Nlast thing on your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.79,0:13:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,By thinking he had the duel won,\NJoey fell right into Marek's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.99,0:13:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey thought by not attacking with\Nmonsters, he was safe from Merrick's traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.93,0:13:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But the trickiest and most dangerous\Ncards in Duel Monsters are trap cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.45,0:13:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and now Merrick's field is full of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.13,0:13:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope Joey learned his lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,because one more mistake like that\Nand he can kiss the finals goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.49,0:13:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's come too far to lose it\Nall to a creep with a bad attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention a bad hairdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more of a hair don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.35,0:13:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick is tough, but you still\Nthink Joey can win, right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.91,0:13:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Think he can win?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he can, right, Yuge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Serenity,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.69,0:13:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's been in tougher situations\Nthan this He just needs a little
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,support from us and he'll be\Ncrushing Merrick in no time Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hang in there, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.47,0:13:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you realized you can't win?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.97,0:13:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you want more\Npunishment, Mr. Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.47,0:14:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you good You may not realize\Nthis because your ponytail's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,tied too tight But I fell into\Nyour little trap on purpose,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.41,0:14:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick Yeah, that's the ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.37,0:14:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just testing you\Nto see if your dueling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.37,0:14:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,skills were any better\Nthan your sense of style.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.61,0:14:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like you passed my exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.67,0:14:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll kick my game up a notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And open up a big tub of\Nduel whip all over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.61,0:14:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, he's got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey had this planned the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Will someone please buy this girl a clue?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.29,0:14:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think Marek's buying his story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.47,0:14:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But you gotta give Joey credit for\Nstaying strong and never giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I give Wheeler\Ncredit for is being all talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Merrick,\Nenough standing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.81,0:14:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in quite a rush to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.09,0:14:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch as I place two\Nmore cards face down. Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting really tired of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.36,0:14:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,they call this game Duel\NMonsters because you're
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:14:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,supposed to fight your\Nopponent with monster cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,not spend the whole game hiding behind\Nyour little trap cards like a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can find me the rule that forbids\Nme from playing trap cards, I'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.85,0:15:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.87,0:15:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That does it, Maric.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's time for\Nme to show you how this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,game is supposed to be\Nplayed with monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.97,0:15:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, I summon Alligator's\NSword in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.79,0:15:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If I attack now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Maric's definitely going to counteract\Nmy move with one of his face-down cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.79,0:15:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't afford to\Nlose any more life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that you were going to show me\Nhow you're supposed to play this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.03,0:15:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.94,0:15:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I strike, he'll knock\Nme out of the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.61,0:15:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna let you off easy, Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,by holding back my attack and\Nplaying this card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.21,0:15:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a smart move for now, but he'll\Nhave to attack Merrick eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And when he does, he\Ncould lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.59,0:15:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey needs a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:15:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.23,0:16:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I choose to end my turn\Nwithout making any moves. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.41,0:16:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's skipping his turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to force me to attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.09,0:16:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Two can play at that game, so I pass also.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps now I'll draw a card worth using.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.57,0:16:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this one won't do it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pass again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now this is\Ngetting out of hand, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.31,0:16:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If neither one of them plays a card,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.19,0:16:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,this is going to be a\Nlong duel and boring, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.05,0:16:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry about that. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing Wheeler's amateur style,\Nhe'll crack long before Marek does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked for it. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.35,0:16:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, don't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what he wants you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.01,0:16:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you're not\Ngonna know what hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.97,0:16:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Rocket Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.09,0:16:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how many trap\Ncards you got on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,because I didn't come\Nto the finals to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.75,0:16:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I fought my way here to duel like\Na man and to win this, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Rocket Warrior, attack\Nhis life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Seek and destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, this is a big mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Trap card: Eye of Ujot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.41,0:17:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the Eye of Ujot appears on the\Nfront of your Rocket Warrior It is under my
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,control And I shall\Nredirect his attack toward
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,one of your monsters\NNo way Rocket Warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,attack his alligator's sword
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.23,0:17:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's gonna work.\NI got a face down card too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.37,0:17:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Fairy Fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.59,0:17:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's activated a trap\Ncard to hide his monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.81,0:17:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Fairy Fox,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocket Warrior's plan\Nof attack has been short
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.45,0:17:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,circuited Time to play peekaboo\NRocket Warrior, attack at once
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.07,0:18:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.17,0:18:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you haven't hung out\Nin the arcade in a while, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.85,0:18:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on to your little game, Marek,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and I found out the weakness\Nof your trap strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even have one\Nsingle monster card,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.19,0:18:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,just a deck overloaded\Nwith trap cards, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.93,0:18:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about putting all your\Neggs in one basket, you egghead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So once I clear the\Nfield of your trap cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,there'll be nothing protecting your\Nlife points That's why I'm Joey Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.31,0:18:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,future Battle City champion And you're\Njust some ugly, bald freak wearing a cape,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.49,0:18:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.40,0:18:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can insult me all you\Nwant But the truth is you've
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.87,0:18:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,already fallen into another\None of my traps What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.99,0:18:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, finish him off so we\Ncan move on to more important
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,matters What do you mean I've\Nfallen into another trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha, you're about to see\Nwhat I mean first hand. You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,while I may be short on monsters I\Npossess a trap card that is both a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.57,0:19:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,trap and a monster I think the barber\Nclipped some of your brain when he
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.55,0:19:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,was cutting your head Prepare to\Nexperience the power of an extremely
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,rare breed of card That's known as a trap\Nmonster But is there such a card? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.83,0:19:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of it\NNot only do I possess
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.53,0:19:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,a rare trap monster card\NBut when you attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you activated it And now feel the\Nrage of a card like none you've ever
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,seen before. It can't be. It is. There's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,no escaping from embodiment of a popus
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.49,0:19:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My card activates like a trap\Nbut attacks like a monster
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say this card disproves your\Ntheory about my decadence weakness, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler So it's true?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.81,0:19:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick has a card that does the job of a\Ntrap and a monster at the exact same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.61,0:19:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so, Mai, but I'm worried about\Nhow powerful its attack strength is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If this card is strong enough, well,\Nthen this could be the end of Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.07,0:19:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it only gets worse, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.29,0:19:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, you've triggered not one,\Nbut three of my Apophis cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.65,0:20:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's time for\Nyou to meet your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.69,0:20:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth, my beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.91,0:20:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do? He can attack me\Nwith three monsters? That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.35,0:20:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,i must say i'm impressed those monsters\Ncan wipe out his life points you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,can do this joey just be strong you're\Nat the end of your rope mr wheeler
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.19,0:20:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, for someone who was so vocal\Nbefore, you seem to be very silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.73,0:20:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you've realized\Nthat talk doesn't win duels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.39,0:20:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes skill and power, and as\Nsoon as my three creatures attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll see exactly what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.85,0:20:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished!
